WEBVTT

00:10.750 --> 00:13.760
It happened a few days before Christmas.

00:14.730 --> 00:19.750
Amagami SS

00:14.740 --> 00:19.740
Morishima Haruka Chapter

00:22.950 --> 00:24.740
What's wrong, Tachibana-kun?

00:24.740 --> 00:27.130
You seem really uneasy for some reason.

00:27.130 --> 00:28.880
I-It's nothing.

00:28.880 --> 00:32.880
I'm actually having tea with you in a family restaurant, Morishima-senpai...

00:32.880 --> 00:35.380
Um... I'm really grateful!

00:37.440 --> 00:38.580
Oh, come on!

00:38.580 --> 00:41.190
You don't have to be grateful for that!

00:41.190 --> 00:44.770
But this is something that would never happen to me...

00:44.770 --> 00:47.400
Well, I guess it actually is happening...

00:47.400 --> 00:50.780
I mean, I just can't believe it!  I'm so happy!

00:50.780 --> 00:53.480
Geez, you're making it such a big deal!

00:57.630 --> 01:00.370
I'm happy that I can have tea with Senpai...

01:00.370 --> 01:03.780
But we had to come to where Kaoru works, of all places...

01:03.780 --> 01:06.340
What'll happen if she sees this?

01:08.280 --> 01:09.420
What's wrong?

01:10.650 --> 01:12.540
N-Nothing!

01:13.100 --> 01:16.300
Senpai, have you decided on what you'd like?

01:16.300 --> 01:18.380
Yeah, I have.

01:18.380 --> 01:22.050
You know, Tachibana-kun, are you okay with eating sweet stuff?

01:22.620 --> 01:25.400
Yes, to a normal extent.

01:25.400 --> 01:29.650
Then... will you share a parfait with me?

01:29.650 --> 01:31.760
A parfait?

01:32.340 --> 01:33.760
This one.

01:34.920 --> 01:36.320
This one?

01:36.320 --> 01:37.030
Yeah.

01:38.600 --> 01:40.910
May I take your order?

01:41.850 --> 01:44.190
Tachibana-kun, can we?

01:44.190 --> 01:47.130
Yes, go ahead.

01:48.490 --> 01:50.800
I'm glad it wasn't Kaoru.

01:51.290 --> 01:57.130
BIG SIZE

01:51.290 --> 01:57.130
For lovers

01:51.290 --> 01:57.130
Shining
Lovers
Parfait

01:51.590 --> 01:53.620
This one, please.

01:53.620 --> 01:56.340
Okay, understood!

01:57.720 --> 02:01.220
Restaurant

01:57.720 --> 02:01.220
Totosu

02:01.750 --> 02:04.530
It must be the one that girl's carrying.

02:06.150 --> 02:07.840
Crap, it's Kaoru!

02:08.910 --> 02:11.580
Tachibana-kun, do you know her?

02:11.580 --> 02:14.310
Yes.  She's my classmate.

02:14.310 --> 02:15.920
I see.

02:15.920 --> 02:19.310
So students from our school actually work here.

02:19.310 --> 02:20.620
I didn't know.

02:20.620 --> 02:21.570
Yeah.

02:21.570 --> 02:22.650
I see.

02:23.120 --> 02:27.290
So it'd be bad if she sees the two of us alone together.

02:27.290 --> 02:29.080
That's not true!

02:30.700 --> 02:33.840
All right, I have a great idea!

02:37.710 --> 02:40.320
Senpai, what are you doing?

02:40.320 --> 02:44.680
Well, nobody'll know you came with me if I hide myself like this, right?

02:44.680 --> 02:46.650
You don't have to do that...

02:46.650 --> 02:48.160
It's fine, it's fine.

02:48.160 --> 02:49.940
It's more fun this way!

02:49.940 --> 02:51.640
Look, here she comes.

02:52.940 --> 02:54.670
Here you go.

02:54.670 --> 02:57.520
A Shining Lovers Parfait!

02:57.400 --> 02:58.860
Shining Lovers Parfait

02:58.860 --> 03:00.720
Y-Yo, Kaoru.

03:00.720 --> 03:05.240
It's rare for customers to order this, so I was wondering who it was...

03:05.240 --> 03:06.810
And it was you.

03:06.810 --> 03:07.870
Who cares?!

03:07.870 --> 03:09.370
That's right, that's right!

03:09.580 --> 03:14.870
So who are you having this special parfait meant for lovers with?

03:15.410 --> 03:17.040
You came with someone else, right?

03:17.040 --> 03:19.440
I saw on your ticket.

03:19.440 --> 03:21.880
W-Well...

03:21.880 --> 03:24.080
Now who could it be?

03:24.080 --> 03:26.890
Senpai's totally amused by this.

03:29.200 --> 03:30.380
U...

03:30.380 --> 03:31.440
U?

03:31.440 --> 03:32.760
U?

03:35.880 --> 03:37.190
...Umehara.

03:40.320 --> 03:41.570
I knew it!

03:41.570 --> 03:43.510
Who cares?!

03:43.510 --> 03:45.000
Is there a problem?!

03:45.000 --> 03:48.060
Nope, I have nothing else to say!

03:48.060 --> 03:49.850
Please enjoy!

03:54.860 --> 03:57.590
Senpai, you can come out now.

03:59.840 --> 04:02.590
So you're having a parfait with Umehara-kun.

04:02.590 --> 04:04.800
That's because you hid yourself, Senpai.

04:04.800 --> 04:08.630
But I was interested in what excuse you'd come up with.

04:09.600 --> 04:11.170
I'm sorry.

04:11.170 --> 04:14.380
Come on, let's have the Shining Lovers Parfait together.

04:18.490 --> 04:19.920
Bye-bye!

04:20.720 --> 04:24.990
The Shining Lovers Parfait I had with Senpai was delicious...

04:24.990 --> 04:29.630
But I get the feeling I lost something...

04:30.600 --> 04:32.690
Christmas will arrive soon.

04:33.200 --> 04:38.050
I wonder if I can spend a happy
Christmas with Morishima-senpai?

04:46.260 --> 04:51.270
Amagami SS

04:46.260 --> 04:51.270
Tanamachi Kaoru Chapter

04:52.920 --> 04:55.980
Kaoru said she has a shift today.

04:55.980 --> 04:59.190
I shouldn't disturb her, so I guess I'll go straight home.

04:59.880 --> 05:00.910
I know!

05:00.910 --> 05:02.610
I'll go read books in the bookstore!

05:03.150 --> 05:05.130
It's almost Christmas.

05:05.130 --> 05:06.790
A date with Kaoru, huh?

05:11.850 --> 05:14.560
Would you like a Christmas cake?

05:14.560 --> 05:17.060
We're taking orders!

05:17.060 --> 05:18.080
Huh?

05:18.710 --> 05:22.270
Our Christmas cakes are delicious!

05:22.270 --> 05:23.320
Kaoru?

05:24.550 --> 05:26.050
Junichi!

05:27.190 --> 05:29.070
W-Why are you here?!

05:29.070 --> 05:33.060
Uh, I was thinking of going to the bookstore for a bit...

05:33.580 --> 05:36.240
Your costume...

05:36.240 --> 05:38.120
Can't you tell?!

05:38.120 --> 05:40.060
It's obviously a Santa costume.

05:40.060 --> 05:41.880
I know that...

05:41.880 --> 05:44.200
Then what?  Is there a problem?!

05:44.200 --> 05:45.910
N-Not really...

05:45.910 --> 05:48.070
It's for my job, so I had no choice!

05:48.070 --> 05:58.080
Shopping
District

05:48.070 --> 05:58.080
Sale

05:48.400 --> 05:51.600
Did you quit your job at the family restaurant?

05:51.600 --> 05:54.130
Of course not.  This is just a temp job.

05:54.130 --> 05:55.450
It pays well.

05:55.450 --> 05:58.080
Man, how many jobs are you working?

05:58.080 --> 05:59.500
Five.

05:59.950 --> 06:01.350
That many?!

06:01.350 --> 06:02.950
Are you doing okay?

06:02.950 --> 06:04.420
I'm totally fine.

06:05.370 --> 06:06.660
But you know...

06:07.040 --> 06:12.050
The man who might become my
new dad said the same thing you did.

06:13.560 --> 06:17.580
You told me that I didn't have to work.

06:18.130 --> 06:19.350
I see.

06:19.350 --> 06:21.140
So are you gonna stop?

06:21.140 --> 06:22.500
I'm still thinking.

06:23.690 --> 06:24.890
I see.

06:25.570 --> 06:26.410
Yeah.

06:28.690 --> 06:30.750
Wait, where do you think you're looking?!

06:30.750 --> 06:32.610
No, I wasn't!

06:32.610 --> 06:35.580
I was thinking your Santa hat with cat ears is really cute!

06:35.580 --> 06:39.200
Liar, that wasn't where you were looking!

06:39.200 --> 06:40.580
It was somewhere lower down!

06:40.580 --> 06:43.400
Well... uh...

06:43.400 --> 06:44.890
Perv.

06:44.890 --> 06:46.660
So what?

06:47.730 --> 06:49.290
You'll buy one, right?

06:50.090 --> 06:53.650
You can have this cake for the cheapest price of 2,500 yen.

06:53.650 --> 06:55.310
It's a loss-incurring discount!

06:56.100 --> 07:00.100
I'm saying that price is too low for viewing my costume.

07:00.790 --> 07:03.530
So that's your loss-incurring discount.

07:07.230 --> 07:11.370
Are you feeling cold from wearing so little?

07:12.430 --> 07:13.680
I know!

07:13.680 --> 07:16.130
Junichi, pay me back with your body.

07:16.670 --> 07:18.670
Help me finish selling these.

07:18.670 --> 07:22.440
How much longer do you want me
to stand here in such cold weather?

07:22.440 --> 07:24.230
F-Fine.

07:25.820 --> 07:27.890
Would you like a Christmas cake?

07:27.890 --> 07:30.830
We're still taking orders!

07:29.400 --> 07:32.600
They're delicious!  Would you like one?

07:31.480 --> 07:34.380
Would you like a Christmas cake?

07:33.040 --> 07:35.800
Would you like one?  They're delicious!

07:37.320 --> 07:39.590
Take care in carrying them.

07:39.590 --> 07:42.130
Thank you for buying!

07:42.940 --> 07:44.020
We sold them all!

07:44.020 --> 07:45.190
Yay!

07:46.270 --> 07:47.700
I'm beat.

07:47.700 --> 07:50.280
Viewing your costume is pretty pricey.

07:50.280 --> 07:51.480
Really?

07:51.480 --> 07:54.170
That wasn't anywhere near enough to pay for it.

07:54.170 --> 07:55.400
Hey now.

07:55.780 --> 07:57.260
Well, whatever.

07:57.260 --> 08:01.370
I got my fill of looking at Kaoru in a Santa suit.

08:01.620 --> 08:06.880
Oh yeah, I should ask where she'd like to go for our Christmas date.

08:07.200 --> 08:12.880
Oh, maybe I should talk to him about our Christmas plans.

08:12.880 --> 08:14.110
You know-

08:15.180 --> 08:16.250
What?

08:16.250 --> 08:17.920
U-Um...

08:22.720 --> 08:25.400
Can I go home now?

08:27.180 --> 08:29.530
Oh... right.

08:30.050 --> 08:31.910
Yeah, that's right.

08:32.670 --> 08:34.260
I see.

08:34.260 --> 08:35.290
Yeah.

08:36.450 --> 08:38.810
S-See you.

08:41.890 --> 08:43.250
Junichi.

08:43.250 --> 08:44.460
What?

08:44.880 --> 08:46.760
Thank you for today.

08:46.760 --> 08:49.500
I'm looking forward to Christmas!

08:49.500 --> 08:51.760
O-Okay!

08:52.260 --> 08:55.210
Don't be sick on Christmas!

08:55.210 --> 08:56.330
Gotcha!

09:02.520 --> 09:07.520
Amagami SS

09:02.520 --> 09:07.520
Nakata Sae Chapter

09:08.310 --> 09:13.940
This is something trivial that happened one December night.

09:14.450 --> 09:19.090
That day was an important anniversary for the boy.

09:19.090 --> 09:20.450
Yet...

09:21.330 --> 09:23.260
Nobody's home.

09:23.880 --> 09:28.160
That's right.  That day was his birthday.

09:28.160 --> 09:35.220
But when he returned home, neither his family
nor a birthday cake was anywhere to be found.

09:35.790 --> 09:44.420
The boy, disappointed that he'd have to spend his birthday alone, quietly shut himself in his closet.

09:44.420 --> 09:45.910
Leave me alone!

09:46.630 --> 09:51.250
I've been abandoned by my family and my goddess of luck anyway.

10:01.610 --> 10:02.800
Hello.

10:04.730 --> 10:08.560
A girl was standing before the boy.

10:08.560 --> 10:14.250
It appears that the goddess of luck
had not abandoned the boy just yet.

10:14.250 --> 10:15.590
Sae-chan.

10:15.590 --> 10:18.720
I-I'm sorry for visiting so late.

10:18.720 --> 10:21.470
What is it?  Are you looking for Miya?

10:21.470 --> 10:24.370
I'm sorry, she's not at home.

10:24.370 --> 10:26.190
Ah, I'm not.

10:26.190 --> 10:30.480
I'm looking for S-Se... no, I-Instructor...

10:30.480 --> 10:31.950
For me?

10:31.950 --> 10:34.030
Y-Yes.

10:34.030 --> 10:35.280
What is it?

10:36.070 --> 10:38.880
Um... uh...

10:38.880 --> 10:40.260
Ha...

10:40.260 --> 10:43.190
Happy birthday!

10:43.640 --> 10:46.190
How'd you know it's my birthday?

10:46.970 --> 10:51.290
Well, Miya-chan told me.

10:51.290 --> 10:55.280
Um... here's your present.

10:55.280 --> 10:56.330
A present?

10:56.330 --> 11:01.860
Y-Yes.  It's nothing grand, though...

11:01.860 --> 11:03.190
Thank you.

11:03.650 --> 11:05.760
I'm really happy.

11:08.270 --> 11:09.800
You must be cold.

11:09.800 --> 11:10.870
Come in.

11:10.870 --> 11:12.730
O-Okay.

11:14.000 --> 11:19.830
I'm sorry there isn't much to do, since nobody else is home.

11:19.830 --> 11:20.900
It's fine...

11:20.900 --> 11:30.870
The boy's phrase, "nobody else is home",
resounded in the girl's head and sent her heart racing.

11:30.870 --> 11:36.690
"Nobody's home", "Nobody's home", "Alone together"...

11:37.790 --> 11:41.040
Boy, I believe in you.

11:41.040 --> 11:45.530
I believe you aren't the type to commit foul play.

11:46.220 --> 11:48.110
Can I open it?

11:48.110 --> 11:49.660
Y-Yes.

11:51.060 --> 11:52.240
A book?

11:52.240 --> 11:54.240
Huh?  An album?

11:56.270 --> 12:02.810
The girl's first birthday present to the boy turned out to be quite the curveball.

12:02.810 --> 12:06.520
What's more, it was a risky high-inside pitch.

12:07.280 --> 12:09.160
W-What's this?!

12:09.160 --> 12:14.780
It was an upper-diagonal pitch that far exceeded the boy's imagination.

12:14.780 --> 12:16.840
"W-What is this?"

12:16.840 --> 12:21.970
"Wooh!", the boy gave a masculine roar in his heart.

12:21.970 --> 12:25.270
T-This is... Sae-chan's...

12:25.900 --> 12:27.180
Yes.

12:27.180 --> 12:30.530
...swimsuit photo, right?

12:31.330 --> 12:32.930
I'm sorry.

12:35.080 --> 12:39.010
This is Sae-chan's qipao photo, right?

12:42.950 --> 12:46.640
And this is Sae-chan's nurse photo, right?

12:48.600 --> 12:52.990
And this is Sae-chan's miniskirt policewoman photo, right?

12:52.990 --> 12:56.020
It truly is a melting pot of excitement!

12:57.730 --> 13:02.780
And this is Sae-chan's n-n-negligee photo, right?!

13:04.530 --> 13:07.740
The boy's thoughts had gone completely berserk.

13:07.740 --> 13:11.550
It was now a berserk train nobody could stop.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.100
Unstoppable.

13:13.100 --> 13:14.500
W-Why...

13:14.500 --> 13:16.140
Why would you give this to me?!

13:16.140 --> 13:18.260
W-Well...

13:18.260 --> 13:21.880
I asked Miya-chan about what you like, Senpai.

13:21.880 --> 13:29.940
She said that you often read photobooks of women wearing swimsuits and other stuff...

13:29.940 --> 13:31.540
S-So you...

13:31.540 --> 13:35.920
U-Um... it's embarrassing after all to have you see them...

13:36.760 --> 13:40.500
Well, I think you look really cute in these photos.

13:40.500 --> 13:42.050
But... no!

13:42.050 --> 13:43.970
No, no!

13:42.410 --> 13:44.000
W-Wait!

13:43.970 --> 13:46.710
Don't look!  Don't!

13:50.160 --> 13:52.830
A-Are you okay?

13:52.830 --> 13:55.540
Y-Yeah, I'm fine.

13:55.540 --> 13:59.810
Ah, the boy's face was buried in the girl's breasts.

13:59.810 --> 14:07.730
That warmth was the best possible present for the boy, one that warmed both his body and soul.

14:10.540 --> 14:12.010
Sae-chan.

14:12.010 --> 14:13.810
Y-Yes.

14:14.810 --> 14:17.260
Thanks for the present.

14:17.710 --> 14:21.060
Do you like it?

14:21.060 --> 14:21.590
Yeah.

14:23.380 --> 14:25.170
I'm glad.

14:28.530 --> 14:30.520
Miya took those photos?!

14:30.520 --> 14:35.520
Yes, she said she knew all about what would please you.

14:37.580 --> 14:40.000
Miya, you're unbelievable!

14:40.000 --> 14:43.240
Ten more days until Christmas Eve.

14:43.240 --> 14:47.670
Will the Goddess of the Holy Night smile upon them both?

14:47.670 --> 14:50.680
At any rate, Boy...

14:50.680 --> 14:52.980
Happy birthday.

14:56.550 --> 14:59.910
I wonder if Nii-nii liked Sae-chan's present!
